{
 "title": "test: chorale, orchestra + piano (mix.py adapter test)",
 "comment": "End-to-end test of mix.py with the orchestra renderer: string sections on all voices, a flute an octave above the soprano and a horn on the bass from bar 5, piano doubling everything from bar 3. Score: orchestration/calibration/chorale.ly, plan chorale.plan.json.",
 "groups": {
